erience with these technologies before attempting installation. Community-based support is available for installation and configuration.",[213,214,216],"h2",{"id":215},"self-hosted","Self-hosted",[218,219,220,229],"card-group",{},[221,222,226],"card",{"icon":223,"title":224,"to":225},"i-mdi-docker","Docker","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fcontainer-docker",[187,227,228],{},"Learn how to set up FiveNet using Docker and the Docker Compose plugin.",[221,230,234],{"icon":231,"title":232,"to":233},"i-mdi-kubernetes","Kubernetes","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fkubernetes-helm",[187,235,236],{},"Deploy FiveNet on Kubernetes using our Helm Chart.",[213,238,240],{"id":239},"cloud-hosted","Cloud-hosted",[187,242,243,244,207],{},"For those who prefer a hassle-free experience, FiveNet Cloud offers a streamlined way to run FiveNet for your roleplay server. Learn more on the ",[203,245,246],{"href":205},"Cloud info page",[221,248,251],{"icon":249,"title":206,"to":250},"i-mdi-cloud","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fcloud",[187,252,253],{},"Get started with FiveNet Cloud for a fully managed solution, eliminating the need for manual setup and maintenance. Perfect for those who want to focus on their roleplay server without worrying about infrastructure.",{"title":255,"searchDepth":256,"depth":256,"links":257},"",2,[258,259],{"id":215,"depth":256,"text":216},{"id":239,"depth":256,"text":240},"md",null,{},true,"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fmethods",{"title":182,"description":189},"1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F1.methods","GTx_J8DS6z83h5Ab-A0j3tlRPq5-OLcdUU_rgT_TBzo",[269,274],{"title":270,"path":271,"stem":272,"description":273,"children":-1},"Versioning","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fversioning","1.getting-started\u002F3.versioning","Learn how FiveNet version numbers are structured and what release and development builds mean.",{"title":40,"path":250,"stem":275,"description":276,"children":-1},"1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F2.cloud","FiveNet Cloud is available today as a managed hosting option for communities that want us to run and maintain FiveNet for them.",1788403271866]